control: Each body request hands its account's credential over and records the latest authentication attempt when it ends
removes: a body request hands its source's credential over without naming the adoption it started from, so a credential replaced while it ran is put back
packages: ./mediate/app
tests: TestAStaleHandOverLeavesTheReauthorization
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

